  "details": "When another player changes clothing using their avatar's customization options, the change is visible to the player making the change but is not reflected for other players in the instance.\n\nDuring testing, my friend changed clothing on their avatar. The clothing changed correctly from their perspective, but from my perspective their avatar remained in the previous clothing configuration.\n\nExpected behavior: When the player changes clothing, the updated avatar customization should become visible to other players.\n\nActual behavior: The player making the change sees the new clothing, while another player continues seeing the previous clothing configuration.",
